+# Vendored `@devicebasedauth/verify`
+
+These files are an unmodified copy of `packages/verify/src/*.js` (tests excluded) from the
+devicebasedauth.org repository (`device-based-auth`), at commit
+`7dbb8adf21ad409340c426f52d2b364b6ccfce26` (the package itself last changed in
+`ba0841a189ce20704811d0c652c7f360cf6e469e`, "S2: verify library fixes from the hashbin integration").
+
+**Do not edit these files here.** devicebasedauth.org requires one evaluator implementation that
+passes every vector in its `spec/vectors/`; a local fix would fork it. Fix the upstream package,
+then re-copy all files and update the commit and hashes below in the same commit.
+
+cronly uses `site.js` (`createSiteAuth`, `createOidcClient`) from `src/auth/dba.js`, and
+`issuer.js` only in tests (to act as a fake issuer). The code is zero-dependency and uses only
+WebCrypto, `CompressionStream`/`DecompressionStream` and `fetch`.
+
+| File | SHA-256 |
+|------|---------|
+| credential.js | `413edcc0c7403d3e83593555ccd971c946dba3eeb67f17a73a55d4b832eec5cd` |
+| grants.js | `be2b50bbc905e54a2829c86c7c2a09db616ebc6d0de1b585ed03b053cef5654b` |
+| index.js | `1f6085a895afe38b27e6e858759a3b5f97c093399df17b5aea560a4ba3316ab7` |
+| issuer.js | `65072ae1ffd393577327489a08d4a3453e3f7cd3893f133315c64cb8647140f2` |
+| jose.js | `1955ec8a5d20636a0c63b5060593ab993a265bbf968725c0fb20f39063af0ed2` |
+| site.js | `b99b78fd1dffa1a3d571d3275e9343a0ca9fa6954a5b8a3f9cfeb424f9d47659` |
+| status-list.js | `9bf4d124fef7e79051bbc175ef20fe6602adf8c9a4732ac6da46b858cdbb4452` |
+| verifier.js | `b97b147fe1a1e108a67a673f77f6d201000e6a0495c9ecc5b8d6c148b13c7cc5` |
+
+To refresh (from a checkout of both repositories side by side):
+
+```sh
+for f in ../device-based-auth/packages/verify/src/*.js; do
+  case "$f" in *.test.js) ;; *) cp "$f" src/vendor/devicebasedauth/ ;; esac
+done
+(cd src/vendor/devicebasedauth && sha256sum *.js)
+git -C ../device-based-auth rev-parse HEAD
+```
